    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " spoke to me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mortal man,” he said, “tell the ruler of Tyre what I, the Sovereign ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", am saying to him: puffed up with pride, you claim to be a god. You say that like a god you sit on a throne, surrounded by the seas. You may pretend to be a god, but, no, you are mortal, not divine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You think you are wiser than Danel,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28.3",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Danel",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": ": or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Daniel",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "(see 14.14).",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " that no secret can be kept from you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Your wisdom and skill made you rich with treasures of gold and silver. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You made clever business deals and kept on making profits. How proud you are of your wealth!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Now then, this is what I, the Sovereign ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", am saying: because you think you are as wise as a god, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will bring ruthless enemies to attack you. They will destroy all the beautiful things you have acquired by your skill and wisdom. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They will kill you and send you to a watery grave. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When they come to kill you, will you still claim that you are a god? When you face your murderers, you will be mortal and not at all divine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You will die like a dog at the hand of godless foreigners. I, the Sovereign ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", have given the command.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " spoke to me again. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mortal man,” he said, “grieve for the fate that is waiting for the king of Tyre. Tell him what I, the Sovereign ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", am saying: you were once an example of perfection. How wise and handsome you were! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You lived in Eden, the garden of God, and wore gems of every kind: rubies and diamonds; topaz, beryl, carnelian, and jasper; sapphires, emeralds, and garnets. You had ornaments of gold. They were made for you",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28.13",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Probable text",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "They were made for you",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; Hebrew unclear.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " on the day you were created. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I put a terrifying angel there to guard you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28.14",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "One ancient translation",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "I put",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "…",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "you",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; Hebrew unclear.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " You lived on my holy mountain and walked among sparkling gems. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Your conduct was perfect from the day you were created until you began to do evil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You were busy buying and selling, and this led you to violence and sin. So I forced you to leave my holy mountain, and the angel who guarded you drove you away from the sparkling gems. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You were proud of being handsome, and your fame made you act like a fool. Because of this I hurled you to the ground and left you as a warning to other kings. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You did such evil in buying and selling that your places of worship were corrupted. So I set fire to the city and burnt it to the ground. All who look at you now see you reduced to ashes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You are gone, gone for ever, and all the nations that had come to know you are terrified, afraid that they will share your fate.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
